  "ingredients": [
    "2.5 cups gluten-free flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.75 cup unsalted butter, softened",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2 large eggs",
    "0.25 cup cream cheese, softened",
    "0.25 cup unsalted butter, softened",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1.5 cups confectioners' sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uK1mQh7aG7tCeCxHWAAprE_yS1s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-240496-gluten-free-sugar-cookies-VAT-step-01-fa6f4555ff0149d2971989787aa40d57.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240496/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk flour, baking powder, and salt together in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ehUCz-yy9X9Mue2YuTdyBepBsBU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-240496-gluten-free-sugar-cookies-VAT-step-02-192071036014471bac56038ffadc595c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240496/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat white sugar, ¾ cup butter, and 1 teaspoon vanilla extract in a bowl with an electric mixer until creamy, 3 to 4 minutes. Beat in eggs, one at a time, until mixture is smooth. Gradually mix in flour mixture until a dough forms.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/27iQ7svztdmcdvUvLmB3mtNflhc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-240496-gluten-free-sugar-cookies-VAT-step-03-00f096db6f364e97a0a1f58f5146c960.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240496/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Form dough into a ball; wrap in plastic wrap and refrigerate for 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fRdUEqeUaAjdnsKC4tj843BFtEo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-240496-gluten-free-sugar-cookies-VAT-step-04-ddf066bcda0c4521a82544884b220431.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240496/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Line two baking sheets with parchment paper or silicon baking mats.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ncDSKOTpPuYby6H5oSttr3L5RRI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-240496-gluten-free-sugar-cookies-VAT-step-05-3e4832cdd6844e049e4cb08a5f95e80a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240496/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll dough on a lightly floured surface and cut into desired shapes using cookie cutters. Arrange cookies on the prepared baking sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0tipMlMoO8JqhbButPPZhTGoXWs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-240496-gluten-free-sugar-cookies-VAT-step-06-fc0f0813c1694c62a4f1e1e322c6c851.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240496/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until edges begin to brown, about 10 minutes, switching racks halfway through. Cool on the baking sheet briefly before transferring to a wire rack to cool completely, 8 to 10 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/E2V-AgjZv2gIucqimJl75fUahjo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-240496-gluten-free-sugar-cookies-VAT-step-07-2f89c555cd8a4468ac520419e2258f20.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240496/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, beat cream cheese, ¼ cup butter, and 1 teaspoon vanilla extract in a bowl using an electric mixer until well combined. Slowly beat in confectioners' sugar until icing is smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XulrL4EZnc--GcF-L7kcmAoMCWY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-240496-gluten-free-sugar-cookies-VAT-step-08-a958a0f57a104f9cb6d74c029925a316.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240496/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread icing onto cooled cookies.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XFSWzGV195r1IsQNyBdPnBZQH8w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-240496-gluten-free-sugar-cookies-VAT-step-09-d06ede1113144ffb815f3e8be0116e83.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240496/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
